        <p data-reveal="">{"In brand work, we translate product truth into culture. We make choices about what to emphasize, what to leave out, and how to earn attention in a crowded world. There's craft in that. There's taste. There's responsibility. And there's always the temptation to take shortcuts. AI is another tool. Brands need to have something worth saying, and they need to say it well."}</p>
